DejaVu fonts, version 2.35, unmodified: Sans, Serif and Sans Mono in
regular, bold, oblique/italic and bold oblique/italic.

Taken from the matplotlib 3.11.2 wheel (PyPI,
matplotlib-3.11.2-cp311-cp311-manylinux2014_x86_64...whl,
matplotlib/mpl-data/fonts/ttf/), which redistributes them unchanged.
Upstream: https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/

Licence: LICENSE (Bitstream Vera / Arev terms; free to use, copy and
redistribute).  SHA256SUMS pins every file.

Used by Charon's engine (appl/lib/web/font.b) through outlinefont(2) to
draw text at any size, weight and slant.
